<article class="env-lemma" id="062N">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/062N">Lemma <span data-tag="062N">27.6.3</span>.</a> The category of vector bundles over a scheme $S$ is anti-equivalent to the category of quasi-coherent $\mathcal{O}_ S$-modules. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Omitted. Hint: In one direction one uses the functor $\underline{\mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}}_ S(\text{Sym}^*_{\mathcal{O}_ S}(-))$ and in the other the functor $(\pi : V \to S) \leadsto (\pi _*\mathcal{O}_ V)_1$ where the subscript indicates we take the degree $1$ part. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>